  "body": "## What's new in v2.5.25-dev.6-alpha1\n\n- factory reset: an if-then where shellcheck wants one\n- kiosk: a remote control drives the whole interface\n- bluetooth: pair a remote control, and keep the radio up for it\n- kiosk: the Cover Flow covers follow the search filter\n- backup: the album and artist information travels with it\n- album and artist information: keeping it is not a switch\n- album and artist information: it stays, and you choose where\n- web admin: one CSRF token per page, not one per request\n- vu store: Titanium turns on its coil, with a needle long enough to reach (v3)\n- vu store: the coil turns with the needle on Glossy and Titanium (v2)\n- vu store: two more meters, a glossy black one and a titanium one\n",
